flowchart TD
  START[First Master Invocation] --> SIGNAL[Read User Mode / Toggle]
  SIGNAL --> MANIFEST[Read Manifest, Artifacts, Timestamps, Runs]
  MANIFEST --> RECONCILE{Does Persisted State Confirm Mode?}
  RECONCILE -->|No / mismatch| RESOLVE[Reconcile Without Overwriting Existing Work]
  RECONCILE -->|Yes| CLASSIFY{New, Legacy, Installed?}
  RESOLVE --> CLASSIFY
  CLASSIFY -->|New| NEW[Discover Problem and Project Context]
  CLASSIFY -->|Legacy| LEGACY[Progressive As-Is Inspection]
  CLASSIFY -->|Installed| REQUEST[Read Request and Resume State]
  LEGACY --> BASELINE[Record Architecture, Pros, Cons, Comments, Evidence]
  BASELINE --> CHANGE{Was a Change Request Included?}
  CHANGE -->|No| WAIT[Persist Artifacts, Timestamp, Log, Next Step; Wait]
  CHANGE -->|Yes| NEW
  NEW --> AGENTS[Compose Validated Pipeline and Delegate Real Specialists]
  REQUEST --> AGENTS
  AGENTS --> REPORT[Persist Run State, Evidence, Handoff, and Report]
